From: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bsps/riscv: Add ESP32-P4 v1 direct-boot BSP

Keep revision-specific ROM ABI, SRAM, clocks and legacy CLIC configuration
under a separate esp32p4v1db BSP. Preserve the upper SRAM/cache partition.
Reject incompatible silicon before selecting a stack or initializing RAM.

Signed-off-by: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
---
 bsps/riscv/esp32/include/p4/chip_definitions.h     | 10 +++++-
 bsps/riscv/esp32/include/p4v1/chip_definitions.h   | 10 ++++++
 bsps/riscv/esp32/irq/irq_c3.c                      | 17 +++++++++
 bsps/riscv/esp32/start/bspsmp.c                    | 10 ++++++
 bsps/riscv/esp32/start/bspstart.c                  | 35 +++++++++++++-----
 bsps/riscv/shared/start/start.S                    | 41 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 spec/build/bsps/riscv/esp32/abi.yml                |  4 ++-
 spec/build/bsps/riscv/esp32/bspesp32p4v1db.yml     | 25 +++++++++++++
 spec/build/bsps/riscv/esp32/optchipvariant.yml     |  2 ++
 .../bsps/riscv/esp32/optcodeflashmappedbase.yml    |  1 +
 .../bsps/riscv/esp32/optdataflashmappedbase.yml    |  1 +
 spec/build/bsps/riscv/esp32/optdramromreserve.yml  |  1 +
 spec/build/bsps/riscv/esp32/optiramsize.yml        |  2 ++
 spec/build/bsps/riscv/esp32/optramcodeorigin.yml   |  4 ++-
